OL,3,GNEWSAMums react to hospital's          
OL,4,Asuspension of gas and air              
OL,6,FMothers have described their experience
OL,7,Fof using gas and air during labour     
OL,8,Fafter a NHS hospital suspended its use 
OL,9,Fin a maternity suite over concerns for 
OL,10,Fstaff safety.                          
OL,12,FBasildon Hospital leaders feared       
OL,13,Fpersistently high levels of the gas    
OL,14,Fcalled Entonox, which provides         
OL,15,Ftemporary pain relief for women giving 
OL,16,Fbirth, in the unit could be causing    
OL,17,Fhealth issues.                         
OL,19,FThe move follows payouts to 121 members
OL,20,Fof staff totalling #735,000 from the   
OL,21,Ftrust in October, due to over-exposure 
OL,22,Fto the gas.                            
